  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ontopriv-provenance#repair-076ad36f331d39b3">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">R1 · is_related_to</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">R1 en el perfil: tenía 9 dominios (Collection, Data_Controller, Data_Processor, Delegate, Minor_infractions_penalties, Penalties_for_Serious_Infringements, Processing, Right_not_to_be_object_to_automated_evaluations, Right_of_access); ahora tiene uno, la unión de esas clases (owl:unionOf), como pide P19 de OOPS!.</rdfs:comment>
