    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">R1 · is_compliant_with_the_following_roles</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">R1 en el perfil: tenía 6 rangos (Addressee_in_verification, Holder_in_verification, Personal_Data_Protection_Authority_in_verification, Personal_data_delegate_in_verification, Responsible_for_treatment_in_verification, Treatment_Manager_in_verification); ahora tiene uno, la unión de esas clases (owl:unionOf), como pide P19 de OOPS!.</rdfs:comment>
