  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/ontopriv-provenance#repair-bdff028afe1604f1">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="es">R1 · General_detail</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">R1 en el perfil: tenía 72 dominios (Addressee_in_verification, Administrative, Administrative_or_judicial_authorities, Admitted_Countries, Applicable_safety_measures, Authorization_for_international_transfer, Authorized_consent, Banking, Banking_stock_or_stock_market_data, Boys_and_girls, Certifying_entity_in_verification, Claims_defense, Commercial, Confidentiality_principles, Conservation_principles, Continuous_control_for_countries_without_consent, Corrective_measures, Credit_data_in_verification, Data_Seniors_data, Data_persons_minors, Data_protection_mechanisms, Deceased_persons_data, Domestic_Companies, Economic, Epidemiological_studies, Exceptions, Exceptions_for_international_transfers_or_communications, Exceptions_to_consent_for_national_transfers, Exceptions_to_the_rights_in_verification, Financial, Follow-up_from_design, Governmental_information_security_mechanism, Health_data_in_verification, Holder_in_verification, Infringement_investigation, International, International_State_to-State_Cooperation, International_companies, Legal, Legal_institutions, Legal_interest_in_verification, Legal_relationship, National_Scope, Notification, Organizational, Personal_Data_Protection_Authority_in_verification, Personal_data_delegate_in_verification, Public_governments, Public_interest, Responsible_for_treatment_in_verification, Right_of_access_in_verification, Right_of_deletion_in_verification, Right_to_consult_in_verification, Right_to_correct_and_update_in_verification, Right_to_information_in_verification, Right_to_portability, Risk_analysis_of_threats_and_vulnerabilities, Safety_principles, Sanctioning_regime, Sensitive_data_in_verification, Solve_an_emergency, Sources_accessible_to_the_public, Technical_measurements, Techniques, Teenagers, Transfer_or_communication, Transparency_principles, Treatment_Manager_in_verification, Unauthorized_consent, Violations_in_verification, Vital_interest_of_another_person, Thing); ahora tiene uno, la unión de esas clases (owl:unionOf), como pide P19 de OOPS!.</rdfs:comment>
    <prov:wasGeneratedBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ontopriv-provenance#activity-repair-r1"/>
    <prov:wasAttributedTo rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/ontopriv-provenance#agent-system"/>
